The Edimax Gemini RG21 or RA21S is an AC2600 router with a maximum WiFi speed up to 800Mbps (2.4GHz) and 1733Mbps (5GHz) and 4 Gbit LAN and 1 Gbit WAN port. 
It features MU-MIMO support with 4 external detachable antennas and 4 internal antennas. The device is marketed as a WiFi Roaming Router (RG21/RA21S) and Access Point (RA21S). But both seems to be identical.

